<title>USA: Travis Cty, Texas, $2.900 mln won by Legg Mason. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Travis Cty, Texas, $2.900 mln won by Legg Mason. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
